# Mobile build (vite build --mode mobile). Loaded ONLY by
# `npm run build:mobile`, which is what the Capacitor Android
# pipeline invokes before `cap sync`.
#
# Same story as .env.desktop: the APK ships without a proxy, so
# VITE_API_BASE must be an absolute URL. Point it at whatever host
# the customer's phones will hit. Local test builds use the LAN IP
# of the API dev machine (phones on the same Wi-Fi can reach it),
# and production APKs point at the droplet / cloud host.
VITE_API_BASE=http://198.211.108.211:4000
